  "question_stem": "The variables $x$ and $\\theta$ satisfy the differential equation $$x \\sin^2 \\theta \\frac{\\mathrm{d}x}{\\mathrm{d}\\theta} = \\tan^2 \\theta - 2 \\cot \\theta,$$ for $0 < \\theta < \\frac{1}{2}\\pi$ and $x > 0$. It is given that $x = 2$ when $\\theta = \\frac{1}{4}\\pi$.",
  "context_texts": [
    "$$\\dfrac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}\\theta}(\\cot^2\\theta) = 2\\cot\\theta(-\\operatorname{cosec}^2\\theta) = -\\dfrac{2\\cot\\theta}{\\sin^2\\theta}$$"
  ],
